1635
01:34:47,583 --> 01:34:50,250
Vamos, Noah. Esfuérzate un poco.

1636
01:34:50,666 --> 01:34:51,541
Está bien.

1637
01:34:55,375 --> 01:34:56,583
Hola, Noah.

1638
01:34:58,041 --> 01:34:59,125
<i>No.</i>

1639
01:34:59,958 --> 01:35:02,916
