1657
01:36:10,708 --> 01:36:11,708
¿Nick?

1658
01:36:12,833 --> 01:36:13,666
¿Nick?

1659
01:36:14,708 --> 01:36:15,833
Gracias a todos.

1660
01:36:17,166 --> 01:36:18,291
