1688
01:37:40,541 --> 01:37:43,500
{\an8}- y presumir a un bombón a tu lado.
- ¿Un bombón?

1689
01:37:43,583 --> 01:37:45,375
Michael.

1690
01:37:45,458 --> 01:37:46,875
